---
layout: layouts/page.njk
pagination:
  data: states
  size: 1
  alias: state
permalink: "/states/{{ state.slug }}/ev-incentives/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ state.name }} EV Incentives 2026"
  description: "{% if state.evIncentiveDetails %}{{ state.evIncentiveDetails | truncate(160) }}{% else %}No statewide EV purchase rebate is confirmed for {{ state.name }} in 2026.{% endif %}"
---

<div class="prose-dark">
{% set guide = stateGuides[state.slug] %}
{% if guide and guide.ev %}
{% include "state-guides/" + state.slug + "/ev-incentives.html" %}
{% else %}

<h2 id="state-incentives">{{ state.name }} EV Incentives</h2>

{% if state.evIncentives and state.evIncentiveDetails %}
<p>{{ state.evIncentiveDetails }}</p>
{% else %}
<p>No statewide EV purchase rebate or tax credit is confirmed here for {{ state.name }} in 2026. Current programs are listed by the <a href="https://afdc.energy.gov/laws/state" rel="noopener">U.S. Department of Energy Alternative Fuels Data Center</a>.</p>
{% endif %}


{% endif %}

<h2 id="federal-incentives">Federal EV Tax Credits in 2026</h2>

{% include "partials/ev-federal-2026.njk" %}

<p>Nationwide context is in the <a href="/guides/ev/ev-tax-credits/">2026 EV incentives guide</a>.</p>

<div class="glass-card metallic-border rounded-2xl p-8 carbon-panel text-center my-10 not-prose">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Ready to Go Electric?</h3>
  <p class="text-silver-400 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">Compare insurance rates for electric vehicles in {{ state.name }}.</p>
